{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps. Step 1, my cart: Espresso beans $24 x1, Ceramic mug $12 x2, Canvas tote $18 x1, with quantities I can change and the subtotal. Step 2, shipping: name, address, city, postcode and email, all required, with a message under a field that is empty or an email without an @. Step 3, payment summary: a choice of Standard delivery ($4, 3 to 5 working days) or Express ($12, next working day) that changes the total, subtotal plus delivery. Then a confirmation with an order number, my name, my email and the total I paid. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"state step=1\nstate cart=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Espresso beans\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Ceramic mug\",\"price\":12,\"qty\":2},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Canvas tote\",\"price\":18,\"qty\":1}]\nstate name=\"\"\nstate address=\"\"\nstate city=\"\"\nstate postcode=\"\"\nstate email=\"\"\nstate delivery=\"standard\"\nstate placed=false\nlet subtotal = sum(cart, i => i.qty * i.price)\nlet shipping = delivery == \"express\" ? 12 : 4\nlet total = subtotal + shipping\nlet orderNo = \"ORD-\" + fixed(length(cart) * 1371 + 40213, 0)\nlet nameOk = trim(name) != \"\"\nlet addrOk = trim(address) != \"\" and trim(city) != \"\" and trim(postcode) != \"\"\nlet emailOk = trim(email) != \"\" and contains(email, \"@\")\nlet shipOk = nameOk and addrOk and emailOk\n\nChatCard \"Checkout\" \"Step {step} of 3\" icon:\"shopping_bag\" status:\"Secure\" tone:accent\n  if step == 1\n    SectionLabel \"Your cart\"\n    each item in cart\n      CartLine item.name \"{item.qty} × ${item.price}\" item.price qty:item.qty -> cart=updateWhere(cart, x => x.id == item.id, x => with(x, \"qty\", result))\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\", money(subtotal, \"$\", 2)]]\n    ActionButton \"Continue to shipping\" primary -> step=2\n\n  if step == 2\n    SectionLabel \"Shipping address\"\n    InputField \"Full name\" \"Jane Doe\" =name error:=(trim(name)==\"\" ? \"Name is required\" : \"\")\n    InputField \"Address\" \"12 Market Street\" =address error:=(trim(address)==\"\" ? \"Address is required\" : \"\")\n    InputField \"City\" \"Bristol\" =city error:=(trim(city)==\"\" ? \"City is required\" : \"\")\n    InputField \"Postcode\" \"BS1 4DJ\" =postcode error:=(trim(postcode)==\"\" ? \"Postcode is required\" : \"\")\n    InputField \"Email\" \"you@example.com\" =email keyboard:email error:=(trim(email)==\"\" ? \"Email is required\" : (contains(email, \"@\") ? \"\" : \"Enter a valid email\"))\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" quiet -> step=1\n      ActionButton \"Continue to payment\" primary enabled:={shipOk} -> step=3\n\n  if step == 3\n    SectionLabel \"Delivery\"\n    OptionList \"How should we deliver?\" =delivery options:[\"standard\",\"express\"] details:[\"3 to 5 working days\",\"Next working day\"] prices:[\"$4\",\"$12\"] -> delivery=result\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\", money(subtotal, \"$\", 2)],[\"Delivery\", money(shipping, \"$\", 2)]]\n    TotalBar \"Total\" \"Ships to {name}\" amount:{money(total, \"$\", 2)} cta:\"Place order\" icon:\"lock\" -> placed=true; step=4\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" quiet -> step=2\n\n  if step == 4\n    Receipt \"Order placed\" \"Thanks {name}, a confirmation is on its way to {email}.\" code:{orderNo} codeLabel:\"Order number\" tone:good icon:\"check\"\n    Details rows:=[[\"Name\", name],[\"Email\", email],[\"Total paid\", money(total, \"$\", 2)]]","usage":{"input_tokens":9436,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1179,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":608,"totalMs":4697}}
